, options.sampleRate);\n  }\n\n  repaired = applyTransientRestore(\n    repaired,\n    options.sampleRate,\n    options.stemType\n  );\n\n  return repaired;\n}\n","numLines":34,"startLine":308,"totalLines":341}}}
